# Agentic administration of the Qwen appliance runs over SSH, which lands on a
# fresh pseudo-terminal for every command. The default tty timestamp binds a
# credential to the terminal that authenticated it, so those commands find no
# credential no matter how recently the user authenticated in the shared admin
# session. A global timestamp makes one authentication cover the user session,
# and the timeout bounds how long it does.
Defaults timestamp_type=global
Defaults timestamp_timeout=180
